        "fun": "Krabby's big pincers are its weapons and help it keep its balance, and if it loses one in a fight, a new one grows back in no time. It burrows into the sand on beaches, and when food is scarce it even eats sand. To scare off attackers, it blows foam around itself to look bigger than it is. Its name plays on 'crabby', meaning grumpy.",
