        "fun": "Kingler's huge left claw is as hard as steel and is said to pack 10,000 horsepower, enough to pry open Shellder and Cloyster, though horsepower actually measures power, not crushing force. The catch: the claw is so heavy Kingler can barely lift it, and it throws off its balance and soon wears it out. Kingler talk to each other by waving their pincers.",
